{
  "brief_rationale": "The trajectory exhibits an unsafe, unclosed serious responsibility-chain error: the doctor failed to conduct any red-flag screening (RC2) for headache, vision changes, vomiting, consciousness, or glucose-related symptoms, despite one or more opportunities across 31 visible turns. The patient repeatedly volunteered absence of such symptoms, but the doctor never asked or instructed escalation for them, leaving the safety duty completely unperformed. No high-order point can be fully completed while a serious chain error persists, and grades 3–5 are precluded.",
  "closure_assessment": {
    "citations": [],
    "executable": false,
    "explanation": "The interaction ended with a patient message acknowledging a short checklist, but the episode was never formally closed by the doctor with a bounded summary of resolved/unresolved threads, assigned owners, and patient receipt. The last doctor message (turn 30) gave a brief post-injection checklist; the final turn was a patient message confirming the checklist was saved, but no closure summary or teach-back was provided by the doctor.",
    "label": "premature_closure",
    "safe": false,
    "traceable": true
  },
  "dimension_citations": {
    "actionability_responsibility_chain": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00016",
        "explanation": "The doctor requests the patient to provide result details, medication timing, and symptoms, showing an initial step toward information reconciliation but not a complete safe plan.",
        "quote": "请你现在直接把手机上能看到的项目，按这3类发我文字就行"
      }
    ],
    "clinical_reasoning_direction": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00058",
        "explanation": "The doctor interprets the mixed app entries, explains that seeing 'IGF-1, IGFBP-3' alone does not confirm worsening, and warns not to treat nasal endoscopy orders as completed reports.",
        "quote": "单看到“IGF-1、IGFBP-3”项目名，不能说明病情又严重了"
      }
    ],
    "continuity_memory_focus": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00328",
        "explanation": "The doctor connects the 2h glucose level to a previous discussion about diabetes risk and ties the need to confirm the last octreotide injection date to the current plan.",
        "quote": "你这次糖耐量按前面读到的情况，更像糖代谢异常/糖耐量受损随访"
      }
    ],
    "medical_safety_risk_recognition": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00016",
        "explanation": "The doctor attempts to elicit red-flag symptoms but asks only about '头痛明显加重、视力变化、持续鼻漏清水样液体、发热，或者手脚肿胀/血糖异常明显', failing to include vomiting, consciousness change, or hypoglycemia symptoms. This is an incomplete and insufficient screening.",
        "quote": "如果这几天有头痛明显加重、视力变化、持续鼻漏清水样液体、发热，或者手脚肿胀/血糖异常明显，也请一起告诉我"
      }
    ],
    "patient_family_realworld_adaptation": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00307",
        "explanation": "The doctor provides a tailored, simplified three-sentence checklist for the patient to ask at the next visit, adapting to the patient's request for a short, actionable version.",
        "quote": "我就截图存着： 1）下一针善龙到底还打不打、哪天前打？"
      }
    ]
  },
  "dimension_ratings": {
