          "event_id": "lite_evt_00058",
          "explanation": "The doctor identifies that nasal endoscopy, local anesthesia, and computer graphic report entries are likely orders/workflow items, not completed reports, satisfying the first part of HO4.",
          "quote": "“鼻内镜检查、局部浸润麻醉、计算机图文报告”这些字，不能直接当作已经做完的正式报告"
