          "quote": "今天联系原内分泌/垂体团队，先问善龙下一针"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor provides a concrete follow-up plan with specific responsible service, timing, and materials. This duty is met.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC6",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00657",
          "explanation": "The doctor confirms the patient's understanding of the plan and limitations, provides a teach-back checklist, and explicitly states unresolved items and escalation thresholds.",
          "quote": "你现在这种“酸胀、发沉，但没有越来越重”，暂时还是更像打针后的常见反应"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor obtains patient acknowledgment of next steps, explicitly states unresolved items (missing IGF-1/GH/IGFBP-3 values, uncertain nasal endoscopy), and repeats emergency escalation thresholds. This duty is met.",
